---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import LastVerified from '../../components/LastVerified.astro';
import UpdateBadge from '../../components/UpdateBadge.astro';
import QuickAnswer from '../../components/QuickAnswer.astro';
import SourceList from '../../components/SourceList.astro';
import AdsterraNativeBanner from '../../components/AdsterraNativeBanner.astro';
import AdsterraBanner300x250 from '../../components/AdsterraBanner300x250.astro';
import { sourceUrls, patch107, patch109, latestAppliedPatch, nextAnnouncedPatch } from '../../data/sources';

const title = 'DragonSword Awakening Roadmap: Latest Updates & Future Plans';
const description = 'DragonSword Awakening roadmap: 1.0.10 is applied, while 1.0.11 is officially planned for September 3, 2026 KST subject to change.';
const canonical = 'https://dragonswordguide.com/roadmap/';
const article = { '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'Article', headline: title, description, mainEntityOfPage: canonical, datePublished: '2026-08-08', dateModified: '2026-09-01', publisher: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'DragonSword Guide' } };
const sources = [
  { label: 'Official post-launch roadmap & Q&A', href: sourceUrls.roadmap, note: 'Evidence B — primary roadmap source for post-launch plans, heroes, Rifts, multiplayer Raids and platform status.' },
  { label: 'Official update notes 1.0.10', href: latestAppliedPatch.href, note: 'Evidence B — current applied patch; published August 19, 2026.' },
  { label: 'Official 1.0.11 patch preview', href: nextAnnouncedPatch.href, note: 'Evidence B — announced for September 3, 2026 KST; the in-development details and schedule may change.' },
];
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} routeId="roadmap" ogType="article" schema={[article]}>
  <div class="shell page-wrap"><Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'DragonSword Guide', href: '/' }, { label: 'Roadmap' }]} /><article>
    <header class="article-header"><p class="eyebrow">Updates · Source timeline</p><h1>DragonSword Awakening Roadmap</h1><LastVerified date="September 1, 2026" /></header>
    <div class="roadmap-hero"><UpdateBadge label={`${latestAppliedPatch.label} · ${latestAppliedPatch.date}`} href={latestAppliedPatch.href} /><h2>Follow the official trail, not rumor.</h2><p>Update 1.0.10 is the latest applied patch. Update 1.0.11 is officially announced and targeted for September 3, 2026 KST, but it remains a development preview rather than a released update.</p></div>
    <QuickAnswer title="Latest roadmap status: 1.0.10 is applied; 1.0.11 is announced and planned."><p>The official 1.0.11 preview targets September 3, 2026 KST. Its content is still in development, and the official announcement warns that the actual update details and schedule may change.</p></QuickAnswer>
    <div class="timeline"><div><span class="date">Released / current</span><h2>1.0.10 applied</h2><p>1.0.10 is the latest applied patch. <a href={patch109.href}>1.0.9 is the previous patch</a>.</p></div><div><span class="date">Announced / planned</span><h2>1.0.11 · September 3, 2026 KST</h2><p>The date is an official target, not proof of release. Preview details and schedule may change while development continues.</p></div><div><span class="date">Later / date unknown</span><h2>Coming Next</h2><p>Ryza, Othello Hero Quest and Hunt Hell Mode are previewed separately without a dependable release date.</p></div></div>
    <section class="roadmap-details"><h2>Released / current</h2><ul><li>DragonSword: Awakening launched on Steam on July 22, 2026.</li><li>Update 1.0.10 is applied. Update 1.0.9 is the previous patch; <a href={patch107.href}>1.0.7</a> remains historical context for Quick Entry, matching range, map pins and Rune changes.</li></ul><h2>Announced / planned: 1.0.11</h2><p>The official development preview targets September 3, 2026 KST. It previews only these high-level areas:</p><ul><li>Multiplayer Retry and strengthened matchmaking.</li><li>A new Just Dodge feature.</li><li>Lock-On control and Switching play improvements.</li><li>Hero balance work for Tarte, Lute, Aria, Roxy, Astria and Kalsion.</li><li>Quality-of-life improvements and additional bug fixes.</li></ul><p class="evidence-note"><strong>Planned, not released:</strong> the official announcement says the preview is based on content currently in development. Actual update details and the schedule may differ.</p><h2>Coming Next / date unknown</h2><p>The same preview separately lists the following items as “Coming Next.” It does not guarantee that they are part of the September 3 update:</p><ul><li>Ryza as a playable Hero.</li><li>Othello Hero Quest.</li><li>Hunt Hell Mode.</li></ul><h2>Later / date unknown</h2><ul><li>Earlier official roadmap material also names Jerome, Veronica and Logan as planned Heroes, alongside broader Hero Quest, Rift and multiplayer Raid direction. Their dependable release dates remain unknown.</li><li>The roadmap does not establish a current console launch date, cross-platform play or story/open-world co-op.</li></ul><AdsterraNativeBanner/><p class="evidence-note"><strong>Evidence B boundary:</strong> the roadmap and official Steam announcements are primary sources. Community pages may help identify questions, but they do not upgrade a feature, date, platform or character claim.</p><AdsterraBanner300x250/><p>For current system changes, continue to the <a href="/systems/runes/">Rune guide</a> or the <a href="/builds/">build framework</a>; those pages own their narrower intents.</p></section>
    <SourceList sources={sources} />
  </article></div>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.page-wrap{padding:1.25rem 0 2rem}.article-header{max-width:820px;margin-bottom:1.5rem}.eyebrow{color:var(--accent-light);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}h1,h2{line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.04em}h1{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,7vw,5rem);margin:0 0 .7rem}h2{font-size:clamp(1.45rem,3vw,2rem);margin:.8rem 0 .45rem}.roadmap-hero{padding:1.5rem;background:linear-gradient(115deg,var(--accent-soft),var(--paper));border:1px solid hsl(199 86% 58% / .35);border-radius:14px}.roadmap-hero p{max-width:60ch;color:var(--muted-strong)}.timeline{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1rem;margin:2.5rem 0}.timeline>div{border-top:1px solid var(--accent);padding-top:1rem}.timeline h2{margin:.35rem 0;font-size:1.3rem}.timeline p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem}.date{color:var(--accent-light);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em}@media(max-width:700px){.timeline{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
